# drive.press with two mods for one file, track 1's ground (tools/port/mods_synth.py's conflict set): the magenta one
# has the higher priority, so its file is used, and the log says which won (docs/port/MODS.md 3).
# until: 0x400000:900
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --mods-dir mods/conflict --screenshot-at 1600 --screenshot mods_conflict.png
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py log mods_conflict.game.log --has "wave 101, track1: Magenta ground's tracks/track1.bin and Green ground's tracks/track1.bin; Magenta ground is first in the order: its file is used"
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py shot mods_conflict.png --rgb 255,0,255 --min 5000
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py shot mods_conflict.png --rgb 0,255,0 --min 0 --max 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race starts at about 23.6 s and its countdown runs 3.5 s
27 A 20        # gas for 20 s
32 STICKRIGHT 1.5
36 STICKLEFT 1.5
47 B 3         # the brake
